# Only needed when the app cannot reach the local services on its own.
#
# Web (`npm run web`) proxies /api/valhalla and /api/evidence through the Expo
# dev server, and native development builds derive the host from the Metro
# bundle URL, so both work with no configuration while the dev server is up.
#
# Set these for a standalone build, a tunnelled dev server, or services running
# somewhere other than the machine serving the bundle.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_VALHALLA_URL=http://192.168.1.10:8002
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EVIDENCE_URL=http://192.168.1.10:8003
# EXPO_PUBLIC_NOMINATIM_URL=https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org

# Where the Expo dev server should forward /api/* for the web build.
# OPENLOOPER_SERVICE_HOST=127.0.0.1
